        ("Animations", "@keyframes Syntax", "How do you define a CSS animation using @keyframes?", "Define the keyframe sequence with percentages (0%, 50%, 100%) or 'from' and 'to', then assign via animation property.", "Easy", "Practical", "@keyframes spin {\n  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n.loader { animation: spin 1s linear infinite; }", "What does infinite mean in animation?"),
